L["BROKER_SHARE_BLOCK"] = "Share this block"
L["TIP_BROKER_SHARE_BLOCK"] = "Makes this block available to your DataBroker addon, which then decides where to show it."
L["BROKER_RELOAD_NOTE"] = "A block you stop sharing is emptied at once and disappears from your DataBroker addon after a /reload (DataBroker cannot remove an object)."
L["HELP_TEXT_BROKER"] = "|cffffd100DataBroker mode is on|r\n|cffff9933You can turn it off at any time:|r click \"Use Tessera's own blocks\" in the Broker tab, or type |cffff9933/tessera broker|r. Tessera then shows its own blocks again, next to your DataBroker addon, with all its options (you can even keep sharing some blocks with that addon). This choice only applies to this display addon: if you install another one later, Tessera offers DataBroker mode again. \"Back to the automatic choice\" in the Broker tab forgets your choices.\n\n|cffffd100What is DataBroker mode?|r\nA DataBroker addon (Titan Panel, ChocolateBar, Bazooka...) is installed, so Tessera lets it display its information: Tessera shows no block of its own, and these options only keep what concerns the blocks it shares.\n\n|cffffd100Broker tab|r\n- Block: pick one of Tessera's blocks.\n- Share this block: makes it available to your DataBroker addon, which decides where to show it (see that addon's own settings).\n- Threshold colors and the block's own settings (gold format, clock, thresholds...) apply to the shared text.\n- A block you stop sharing is emptied at once and disappears after a reload (button in the tab, or /reload).\n\n|cffffd100Using shared blocks|r\n- Hover: Tessera's tooltip.\n- Left click: works for blocks with a simple action (volume, whispers...). Blocks that open a Blizzard window (bags, character, map...) can only do it from a Tessera block, not from another addon's bar.\n- Shift + click: copies the value into the chat.\n- Right click: the block's settings in Tessera.\nA \"Tessera\" button is shared too: it opens these options.\n\n|cffffd100Commands|r\n/tessera or /tes: options\n/tessera broker: DataBroker mode on or off\n/tessera bug: report to copy into a bug report"
L["BROKER_POPUP_TEXT"] = "%s is installed: Tessera is now in DataBroker mode.\n\nYour DataBroker addon displays Tessera's blocks, and Tessera shows none of its own. Pick the shared blocks in the options, Broker tab.\n\nYou can turn this mode off at any time: the button below, the Broker tab, or /tessera broker. This choice only applies to this display addon."
